  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YNDCRTF Trust Fund National Dialogue Yemen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">YNDCRTF Trust Fund nationell dialog Jemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A multi donor trust fund established with the objective to support    Yemeni efforts to organize and manage a National Dialogue and         Constitution making process that is transparent, inclusive,           participatory, and effective. The intervention includes provision of  technical and political advisory services, support to the operations  of the National Secretariat, and outreach to various constituencies.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En multi donor trust fund etablerad med syftet att st&#xf6;dja jemenitiska anstr&#xe4;ngningar att organisera och leda en nationell dialogprocess     samt en konstitutionsutvecklingsprocess som &#xe4;r transparent,           inkluderande och effektiv. Insatsen inkluderar tillhandah&#xe5;llande av   teknisk och politisk r&#xe5;dgivning, st&#xf6;d till det nationella             sekretariets verksamhet samt ut&#xe5;triktade insatser till olika grupper.</narrative>
  </description>
